            "review_title": "Review at Gammer Beer",
            "review_text": "SarahH70\nManchester, United Kingdom294 contributions\n0\nGreat place to dine with something for everyone\nDec 2025 • Friends\nWe ate here as it was close to our hotel and quite a large place so easy to get a table without a reservation.\nExtensive menu with a choice of western and Vietnamese/Asian cuisine so something for everyone. Very reasonably priced and good service. Had a bit of a vibe of a German Beer Keller and they also have their own brew - Yellow/Lager or Black/Stout - both of which were very good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 12, 2026",
